# Maintenance and Monitoring Guide for Notion & GitHub API Server

This guide provides comprehensive instructions for maintaining and monitoring your Node.js Express application that interfaces with Notion and GitHub APIs. It includes essential practices for system health monitoring, backup procedures, performance tuning, and a maintenance schedule.

## Table of Contents
1. [System Health Monitoring](#1-system-health-monitoring)
   - [Health Check Endpoints](#health-check-endpoints)
